OL,2,W//%*// //%Q%**,$-.,%,. (,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,3,AKing Charles arrives in Guyana as
OL,4,ABahamas visit declared 'diplomatic
OL,5,Asuccess'
OL,6,
OL,7,FThe King is due to have an audience
OL,8,Fwith President Irfaan Ali and will
OL,9,Fattend a state reception celebrating
OL,10,Fthe 60 years of bilateral relations
OL,11,Fbetweeen the two nations.
OL,13,FAfter visiting Guyana, the King will
OL,14,Ftravel to Antigua and Barbuda, where he
OL,15,Fwill open a major Commonwealth leaders
OL,16,Fsummit in his role as the head of the
OL,17,F"family of nations".
OL,23,APub: 29-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
